  "details": "VRChat Android client shows corrupted thumbnails/UI images only on Snapdragon 8 / Adreno devices.\n\nAffected:\n\n- Galaxy S25 Ultra\n\n- Galaxy Z Fold7\n\nNot affected:\n\n- Galaxy Android tablet with MediaTek SoC\n\nSymptoms:\n\n- Friend/world thumbnail images are heavily corrupted with yellow/green blocky artifacts.\n\n- UI text and 3D world rendering look mostly normal.\n\n- Clearing VRChat cache does not fix the issue.\n\n- The same account/content displays correctly on the MediaTek device.\n\nExpected:\n\n- UI thumbnails should render normally.\n\nSuspected area:\n\n- Texture decoding/upload/rendering path for UI thumbnails on Adreno GPU",
